<title>HONG KONG: HK &amp; China Gas 1996 profit up 19 percent.</title>
<headline>HK &amp; China Gas 1996 profit up 19 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  65.0    vs  55.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   23.0    vs  23.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			   1,946.1 vs  1,635.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		    4,796.9 vs  4,252.7</p>
<p>    Company name		Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 April 16-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  May 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong and China Gas produces and distributes gas.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one share for every five shares held.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the bonus issue and the exercise of warrants.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 35 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 12 cents).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
